<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3862/67  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7239/42  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9386/96  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4412/22  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.56/60   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8174/49  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1690.2/1.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     113.47/57  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6891/41  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.1990/63  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5632/52  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6362/72</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$341.50/00</p>
</text>
